        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-125072",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our lead product candidate, ML-007C-MA, is a fixed-dose combination of an M1/M4 muscarinic agonist, ML-007, co-formulated with a PAC, which we are initially developing for the treatment of schizophrenia and ADP.",
        "start_character": 13569,
        "end_character": 13780
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-125072",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-125072-85fd6036b3642de7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-125072",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our lead product candidate, ML-007C-MA, is a fixed-dose combination of an M1/M4 muscarinic agonist, ML-007, co-formulated with a peripherally acting anticholinergic, or PAC, which we are initially developing for the treatment of schizophrenia and Alzheimer's disease psychosis, or ADP.",
